name: sim.getEngineInt32Param
description: Deprecated. See properties instead
luaSynopsis: int int32Param = sim.getEngineInt32Param(int paramId, int objectHandle)
pythonSynopsis: int int32Param = sim.getEngineInt32Param(int paramId, int objectHandle)
inputs:
1. paramId: engine parameter identifier.
2. objectHandle: handle of the shape or joint, or -1 to retrieve a global engine parameter
outputs:
1. int32Param: value of the requested parameter
